{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"streaming-cancel-abort","content_sha256":"sha256:26d1412312cb577b4e4cda4b8f66a553e4d5f6ced88753733fa99cd6ae91dce9","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789926384.201686,"domain":"llm-inference","explanation":"取消/断连要立即 abort 并回收 KV/调度资源，防止僵尸请求占用显存与吞吐;这是流式服务可靠性与成本控制的基本要求。","id":"q-inference-streaming-cancel-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"及时检测断连并 abort 该请求、立刻释放其占用的 KV cache 块与调度槽，避免僵尸请求持续占显存/算力拖垮其他请求；这对高并发下的稳定性与成本很关键"},{"id":"b","text":"继续把该请求生成完再丢弃"},{"id":"c","text":"断连不影响服务端，无需处理"},{"id":"d","text":"应保留其 KV cache 以备重连，永不释放"}],"prompt":"在线流式服务里，客户端中途断开/取消请求，服务端最该做什么？","review_state":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"reliability","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"vLLM request lifecycle (docs)","url":"https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"serving","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
